# Web app

- Server components read from Supabase through `supabaseServer()` in `lib/supabase/server.ts`; the main read model is the `park_overview` view. Add columns to that view (in a new migration) rather than joining in the client.
- Next 15: `params` and `searchParams` are Promises; `await` them.
- Filters live in the URL (GET form), so views can be bookmarked and shared.
- Keep demo mode working: anything new the pages query must also be served by `lib/supabase/demo.ts` and present in `demo/data.json` (regenerate with `pipeline/scripts/make_demo.py`).
- Look: plain, dense acquisitions tool. Stone neutrals, one red/amber scale for scores, tabular numbers (`.num`). No gradients or shadows.
- Claude calls happen only in server routes (`app/api/*`), with `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` from the server environment.
- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` before committing.
